# Scope of the committed graphify code-map (see AGENTS.md).
# We map the cerebro fork surface — the code agents actually get confused by —
# not the whole 50 MB monorepo, to keep the committed graph.json small enough
# to version and rebuild on every merge to main.
#
# Ignore everything, then re-include the cerebro zone.
/*

# Cerebro server code
!/server/
/server/*
!/server/internal/
/server/internal/*
!/server/internal/cerebro/

# All cerebro frontend/runtime packages
!/packages/
/packages/*
!/packages/cerebro-*/

# The graphify skill itself (so "how does the map work" is answerable)
!/.agents/
/.agents/*
!/.agents/skills/
/.agents/skills/*
!/.agents/skills/graphify/
